11ob09re2img05.jpg", "id": 5, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>:  I ate chocolate the other day, and I was OK.<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Aunt Nelly</span>: It's possible it's the sushi. Raw fish is notorious for making people sick.", "time": "36000"}, {"image": "engenn4le11ob09re2img05.jpg", "id": 6, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: I have to lie down. I'm feeling pretty bad.<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Aunt Nelly</span>: Oh, dear. I'm going to stir the soup and then come check on you.", "time": "46000"}], "coverimg": "engenn4le11ob09re2img05.jpg"}, "type": "slideshow"}], "template_override": 1, "_data": [], "type": "audio", "title": ""}], "id": 0, "type": "scholar", "_data": [{"type": "lab_options", "contents": [{"content": true, "type": "has_nav"}, {"content": true, "type": "has_exercise_controls"}]}]}]}